      <h2>Our mission</h2>
      <p>
        All Green Foundation is a community-driven non-profit initiative dedicated
        to sustainable gardening, food security, and environmental education.
      </p>
      <p>
        Our garden provides a practical learning environment where people of all
        ages can develop gardening skills, work together, and learn to protect
        natural resources.
      </p>
      <p>
        Learn more about <a href="garden.html">our garden</a>,
        <a href="activities.html">our activities</a>, and
        <a href="contact.html">how to contact us</a>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section highlight">
      <h2>Our goals</h2>
      <ul class="goal-list">
        <li>Encourage sustainable gardening practices.</li>
        <li>Share gardening and environmental knowledge.</li>
        <li>Support community participation and food growing.</li>
        <li>Promote responsible use of soil and water.</li>
      </ul>
